# W7-ALL04-ALT2 (fv7c, w7sus 13b #1): a house with index >= 8 auto-acquires.
# ALL04's PlayerAlt2 is engine house 10 (PlayerControl, allied to the player).
# Unit::seen_by_mask was uint8_t and only stamped for houses < 8, so every
# house-10 unit failed the targeting test and never auto-acquired a unit
# (the original's house masks are 32-bit, FUN_004F98B0). Three PlayerAlt2 GIs
# are spawned on the plateau with two Russian1 Conscripts 3 cells away; the
# GIs must pick them up by their own Guard scan.
set render_every 600
set on_quit continue
set campaign ALL04u.MAP GDI
until 60 scene == campaign-load
click start
until 300 scene == game
wait 30
cheat spawn E1 10 cell 112 52
cheat spawn E1 10 cell 112 53
cheat spawn E1 10 cell 112 54
cheat spawn E2 1 cell 109 52
cheat spawn E2 1 cell 109 54
wait 5
dump
until 90 ntgt(10) >= 3
assert ntgt(10) >= 3
dump
end
